<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="inventory.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="inventory">
    <!-- Tier 3 framework migration + mouse interactivity. Gated per selector
         subclass via inventory_selector::uses_rml(). Title + hint header / a
         single scrolling flat list of rows, flattened across every visible
         column (nested data-for is avoided in this codebase) / footer. Each
         row is finished markup (invlet + cell text); category rows render as
         a header; the active column's selected row gets the cursor
         highlight; col_first divides one column's rows from the next via
         CSS. Keyboard AND mouse (click/hover, Shift+click range-select in
         multiselect mode) both drive the same execute() loop. -->
    <div class="panel inv-panel">
        <!-- SLICE 2: stats header. Title/hint on the left, the weight/volume
             stats block right-aligned on the right (mirrors draw_header's
             display_stats right_print). Stats vector is empty when display_stats
             is off, so the right block collapses. -->
        <div class="inv-header">
            <div class="inv-header-text">
                <div class="inv-title" data-rml="title_rml"></div>
                <div class="inv-hint" data-rml="hint_rml"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="inv-stats">
                <div class="inv-stat" data-for="s : stats" data-rml="s.text_rml"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Mouse interactivity: every visible column's rows are flattened into
             one vector (rows) — this codebase avoids nested data-for — so this
             is a single flat data-for with per-row click/hover. col_first
             (stamped in rml_sync()) marks each new column's first row; the
             CSS .colstart divider (inventory.rcss) keeps columns visually
             distinct despite the flat list. -->
        <div class="inv-list scroll-pane">
            <div class="inv-row" data-for="row : rows"
                 data-class-category="row.is_category"
                 data-class-selected="row.selected"
                 data-class-colstart="row.col_first"
                 data-event-click="on_select(it_index)"
                 data-event-mouseover="on_hover(it_index)"
                 data-rml="row.text_rml"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- SLICE 6: footer carries the filter indicator (left) + nav-mode hint
             (centered), mirroring draw_footer. -->
        <div class="inv-footer">
            <span class="inv-filter" data-rml="filter_rml"></span>
            <span class="inv-mode" data-rml="footer_rml"></span>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
